/// session, such as a game map or player information. Add filter options to
/// further restrict how a game server is chosen, such as only allowing game
/// servers on ACTIVE instances to be claimed. When a game server is
/// successfully claimed, connection information is returned. A claimed game
/// server's utilization status remains AVAILABLE while the claim status is
/// set to CLAIMED for up to 60 seconds. This time period gives the game
/// server time to update its status to UTILIZED after players join. If the
/// game server's status is not updated within 60 seconds, the game server
/// reverts to unclaimed status and is available to be claimed by another
/// request. The claim time period is a fixed value and is not configurable.
/// If you try to claim a specific game server, this request will fail in
/// the following cases: If the game server utilization status is UTILIZED .
